      "and no existing session fits. It runs supervised (it survives restarts), is listed by ListAgents and reached with SendMessage; its " +
      "destructive actions wait for the administrator's approval like yours, and it inherits none of your always-allow rules. Limits: at most 7 " +
      "sessions, a unique name, a directory under /root (not a hidden one), 3 hires an hour. You can NEVER retire it yourself: see session_retire.",
