      "who may give commands). Refused at once when that computer reports Claude Code is not installed (the error says what the user must do). " +
      "If the session cannot start there, a Mint OS turn tells you why: pass that on plainly. Its reports reach you as turns; give more instructions " +
      "with machine_tell; machine_release when done.",
    inputSchema: {
      type: "object",
      properties: {
        machine: { type: "string", description: "The computer's name or id (machine_list); may be left out when only one is linked." },
        purpose: { type: "string", description: "What to do there, in plain words: this is the laptop session's first message." },
